pect","preinspect","reinspect","superinspect","uninspected"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/inspect#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/ɪnˈspɛkt/","us":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/En-us-inspect.ogg/En-us-inspect.ogg.mp3"},"wordFamily":["inspectability","inspectable","inspectee","inspecter","inspectingly","inspection","inspector","inspectoscope","inspect the plumbing","misinspect","preinspect","reinspect","superinspect","uninspected"]}